  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e04-scene-09",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "回学校找学生观众  (Recruiting Student Audience Members)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Right after Chun Yuqiao leaves, Qin Xiao receives a new task from her network director: returning to Media College to recruit front-row student audience members for Star Night. Listen to Qin Xiao's lines first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "这位大师兄办事真的很利落。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "大概这就是我们传媒学院的校风吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "您需要我抽空回一趟传媒学院吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我听说以前都是请在校大学生做前排观众。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "负责这项工作的同事前两天离职了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我刚离开学校，做这件事很合适。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "星天那边准备得很到位，咱们也得好好表现。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "好的，我明白您的意思了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "不过现在的学生对于这种事，积极性没有以前那么高了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "一人一百块钱的话，我去学校联系一下试试。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "这位大师兄办事真的很利落。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our senior alumnus handles everything so crisply.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "大概这就是我们传媒学院的校风吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Perhaps that is the spirit of our Media College.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "您需要我抽空回一趟传媒学院吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you need me to find time to visit Media College?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我听说以前都是请在校大学生做前排观众。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I heard we usually invite college students to fill the front audience rows.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "负责这项工作的同事前两天离职了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The colleague in charge of that task resigned two days ago.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我刚离开学校，做这件事很合适。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Since I just left campus, this task suits me well.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "星天那边准备得很到位，咱们也得好好表现。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian has prepared thoroughly, so our side should do well too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "好的，我明白您的意思了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Alright, I understand what you mean.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "不过现在的学生对于这种事，积极性没有以前那么高了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'However, students nowadays are not as keen on this sort of gig as before.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "一人一百块钱的话，我去学校联系一下试试。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'At a hundred yuan per person, I will contact campus and give it a try.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "这位大师兄办事真的很利落。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "大概这就是我们传媒学院的校风吧。",
      "gap": 0.5
